ed handover and replacement processes that protect model quality and programme.</p></div></section><section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap sd\">\n  <div><p class=\"lab\">Proposition</p><p class=\"big\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Continuity is a process, not a promise: <em>documented handover, standing backup profiles and a replacement workflow.</em></p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/request-talent/?service=BIM%20Workforce%20Continuity\">Request BIM professionals <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sdside\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Disciplines available</p><ul class=\"deliv\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><li>All disciplines</li></ul></div></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"qual\">\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">The problem</p><h3 class=\"h3\">What clients tell us</h3><ul><li>Resource resignation mid-project</li><li>Lost model knowledge</li><li>Delayed replacement hiring</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"rv ok\"><p class=\"lab\">The ENGISOFT approach</p><h3 class=\"h3\">How this model solves it</h3><ul><li>Handover notes and model status logs</li><li>Pre-identified backup profiles</li><li>A defined replacement workflow</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"rv ok\"><p class=\"lab\">Every placement includes</p><h3 class=\"h3\">Checked and recorded</h3><ul><li>Role-specific technical assessment with a verification date</li><li>Software proficiency checked against your project stack</li><li>Alignment to your BEP, LOD matrix and naming standards</li><li>Periodic performance check-ins, scoped per engagement</li></ul></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Who we place</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Professionals <em>for this model.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/verified-talent/\">How we veri